  `:sim:jvmTest` now resolves via `GRADLE_RO_DEP_CACHE`.
- ✅ **`EngineOffKinematicClampSpec.kt:151`** backtick `;` → ` — ` (em-dash);
  compiles. Landed in commit `b72a1d5` (verify-pass cleanup).
- ✅ **`ARR-EXTEND-FOR-GA` + `ARR-TURN-BASE`** moved from `AwaitApproach` to
