### fn-28 Engine pass C — 4 new goldens closing the most deferments (filed + closed 2026-05-16)

The fn-28 epic landed **four new sim goldens** that closed seven deferments + introduced the first emergency-event anchor in the suite:

- **fn-28.1–.3 (G3a-react-density-altitude)** — first **apron-side reactive recognition**. `WeatherObservation.oat` field + per-aerodrome typed projection `DensityAltitudeInput(oat, qnh, fieldElevation)` + `AircraftType.maxDensityAltitudeFt: Feet?` nullable per-type advisory (C172 = 5000 ft FAA AC 61-107B §3-1; B738 = null applicability fallthrough). `computeDensityAltitudeFeet(input): Feet` named pure function (R17 anchor — sim/unit tests assert against function output, not prose). `MissionStep.DECLINE_DEPARTURE` + `CompletionMode.NON_COMPLETING` apron-terminal pair (R15 + R20). `CompoundTask.replaceFromActivePrimitive(List<TaskNode>)` is the **sole fn-28-introduced suffix-rewrite primitive** (R13 — existing `replaceChild` machinery unchanged on its circuit-only path). `isDensityAltitudeDeclineEligible(mission)` named guard (R16 — pre-taxi shapes; not shared with abort). `applyDensityAltitudeDecline` + `applyCognitiveSuppression` focused seam (R14 round-13 Major 1). Sim golden `G3aPilotReactiveDensityAltitudeTest` with three-layer pin (numerical DA via the named function; mission-tree DECLINE_DEPARTURE primitive at currentTask; ZERO `Request(RequestTaxi)` transmissions). Closes `D-PASS-g3a-react-other-poh-triggers` (DA-leg).
- **fn-28.4–.5 (G3a-react-multi-aircraft)** — first **multi-aircraft reactive-GA** with controller-side sequencing. `BeliefState.goAroundInProgressByRunway: Map<RunwayId, GoAroundInProgress>` persistent runway-scoped belief slice (R23 — round-7 Major 3, lives on BeliefState not ControllerView). `Observe.resolveGoAroundRunway` Either-returning resolution helper (round-9 Major 1 fail-closed). `BeliefState.withGoAroundInProgress` fold (SET on `ControllerEvent.GoAroundDetected` with first-writer-wins tie-breaking; CLEAR on pattern-rejoin `Report(Downwind/Final/Base)` with `receivedAt > setAtTime` strict-inequality; CLEAR on 60s deterministic timeout; NO runway-vacate clause per round-7 Major 4 / round-8 Major 3). `ARR-EXTEND-FOR-GA` rule + `ARR-TURN-BASE` gated `Not(GoAroundInProgressOnRunway)`; existing `SupersessionRelation(TurnBase, ExtendDownwind, ABANDON)` row drops B's prior `ExtendDownwind` coordination — NO new supersession row. Sim golden `G3aPilotReactiveMultiAircraftTest` with three scenarios (crosswind GA + extend-downwind to B; tailwind GA + same; GA-recovery via A's pattern-rejoin clearing belief → TurnBase fires same-cycle) + determinism pin (two-run identical-seed equality). Closes `D-PASS-g3a-react-multi-aircraft-{crosswind,tailwind}`.
- **fn-28.6–.7 (G3b cross-aerodrome reactive-GA)** — first **cross-aerodrome reactive-GA**. `isTransitArrivalReactiveGoAroundEligible(aircraft, mission)` named guard (R18; data-honest predicate parts — Transit goal + Transit root-name gate per codex round-1 + wind-reactive eligible step + Final phase + active runway + flat-shape `activeCompound() == null` no-refire invariant). `deriveCrosswindEvent` / `deriveTailwindEvent` widened to disjunctive eligibility `isReactiveGoAroundEligible(mission) || isTransitArrivalReactiveGoAroundEligible(aircraft, mission)` (round-12 Major 1; round-16 Major 1 — recognition is in `derive*Event` NOT inside appliers). `applyCrosswindGoAround` / `applyTailwindGoAround` Transit-dispatch fork to shared `applyTransitArrivalReactiveGoAround` helper using `replaceFromActivePrimitive([goAroundTask(), circuitTask(), groundArrivalTask()])` (R13 + R22 — existing GA TaskNodes, NO destination-GA placeholder enum/string per round-5 Critical 2) + `mission.resetForGoAround(now).copy(root = rewrittenRoot)` pre-rewrite reset placement (round-16 Major 2) + R19 Tick A intent `climbSpeedMps + Final + None + patternAltitude`. `planRoute` Transit-cruise discriminator (R14 round-14 Major 1). Sim golden `G3bCrossAerodromeReactiveTest` (both axes) + `Fixtures.LOWG_LJMB_VFR_REACTIVE` cross-aerodrome fixture variant. Closes `D-PASS-g3b-react-cross-aerodrome-{crosswind,tailwind}`.
- **fn-28.8–.9 (G0-abort-takeoff)** — **first emergency-event anchor**. `AircraftState.engineRunning: Boolean` ground-truth field (read by physics + abort recognition only, per the firewall contract documented in the field KDoc). `SimEvent.EngineFailure(aircraftId, time, seq, source = AgentId.System)` with body-declared `source` val per round-1 codex fix (callers cannot mis-author the source). `Step.handleEngineFailure` loud-fail on unknown aircraft + idempotent on already-failed + NO synthetic wake event per round-2 Major 4 (the pilot's regular per-aircraft `PilotDecisionTick` cadence picks up the event on the next scheduled tick). `InstructorInput.EngineFailureAt(aircraftId, time)` typed cockpit-side briefing input + `toInitialEvents(baseSeq)` / `withFixtureBaseSeqAdvanced` test-scaffolding translator pair (the **instructor channel** is the test-scaffolding seam through which sim-level emergencies enter as cockpit-side observations rather than world-side hooks — same shape as the existing `CircuitOutcome.GoAround` instructor briefing for fn-11.1's trained-GA plan). `advanceKinematics` R12 engine-off clamp (decel allowed; accel blocked). `MissionStep.ABORTED` + `CompletionMode.NON_COMPLETING` runway-terminal pair (R15 + R20). `isAbortTakeoffEligible(mission)` named guard (R16 split — takeoff-roll mission shapes, distinct from `isDensityAltitudeDeclineEligible`). `PilotEvent.AbortTakeoff(aircraftId, speedAtFailure)` leaf + `deriveAbortTakeoffEvent` 4-check gate (engineRunning + pre-VR strict + phase + mission shape). **R21 final branch order locked**: `DecisionAltitudeWithoutClearance → DensityAltitudeDecline → AbortTakeoff → TailwindLimitExceeded → CrosswindLimitExceeded`. `applyAbortTakeoff` with R13 `replaceFromActivePrimitive([PrimitiveTask(ABORTED, NON_COMPLETING)])` + at-rest intent + `suppressSameTickCognitive = true` payload covering ALL pilotDecide return paths via the shared `applyCognitiveSuppression` focused seam (R14 round-15 Major 2). Sim golden `G0AbortTakeoffEngineFailureTest` with **dynamic event injection** via the new `runUntilWithStateTraceAndInjection` + `EventInjection` driver variant (positive: observes ClearedForTakeoff in trace → injects EngineFailureAt(t_CTO + 1ms); three-layer pin: instant-stop, mission-tree rewrite, never-airborne. Negative: post-rotation injection → abort gate fails on speed; test ENDS — no recovery flow). Closes `D-AUDIT.9.III-FOLLOWUP`.

**Closure tally:** 6 archive flips (D-PASS-g3a-react-other-poh-triggers; D-PASS-g3a-react-multi-aircraft-{crosswind,tailwind}; D-PASS-g3b-react-cross-aerodrome-{crosswind,tailwind}; D-AUDIT.9.III-FOLLOWUP), 0 new deferments authored against the epic's scope, net –6.

**Goldens count post fn-28:** 9 → **13** (G3a-react-density-altitude, G3a-react-multi-aircraft, G3b, G0-abort-takeoff added).

**Reactive-go-around coverage post fn-28:** sextuple-reactive (six pilot-reactive recognition axes closed — self-initiated DA-without-clearance, pilot-trained, ATC-instructed-obstruction, pilot-reactive crosswind, pilot-reactive tailwind, pilot-reactive density-altitude apron-decline).

**Instructor channel doctrine:** the instructor channel architecture introduced at fn-28.8 (typed `InstructorInput` cockpit-side input + `toInitialEvents` fixture-translator + `withFixtureBaseSeqAdvanced` seq plumbing + dynamic injection via `runUntilWithStateTraceAndInjection` post-step hook) is the foundation for future D-AUDIT.9.IV (fuel exhaustion / divert) + D-AUDIT.9.V (icing / weather deviation) emergency anchors. The pilot firewall stays clean: emergency events are cockpit inputs (instructor briefings), never world-side state smuggled through a back-channel.

