**CB-11** — Kotlin action certification gate for FM kernel-shaped safety checks — DONE (2026-05-09)
Controller instruction emission is now routed through `ActionCertifier` for
procedure actions. The gate classifies emitted instructions into
runway/surface/air-path/separation/no-certification plans, rejects unsupported
or incompatible actions with typed failures surfaced in decision traces, carries
certification evidence on outputs and coordination reissues, preserves
conditional dispatch through the ledger, and derives action targets from the
instruction target. The repo-wide quality cleanup that remained after this work
was closed in `QUAL-1`.
Impact: H | Effort: M

